title: Veeam: License
agents: special
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the license of a Veeam Backup & Replication server,
 collected via the Veeam special agent. It reports the license edition,
 status, expiry, support expiry and consumption.

 This check is {OK} if the license status is {Valid}. It is {CRIT} if the
 status is {Invalid} or {Expired}. Any other or absent status makes the
 service {UNKNOWN}.

 {WARN} and {CRIT} levels can be set for the time remaining until the
 license expires, the time remaining until support expires, and the
 license consumption. Consumption is reported for whichever of instances,
 sockets or capacity applies to the license type; the other two are
 omitted.

discovery:
 One service is created per host, if the Veeam special agent could read
 the license.
